emely tomboyish and has no patience. Maria's arrival unsettles Ayano and makes her re-examine her feelings."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From JAST USA"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c6570"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/89/89758294b45f4156d1f9501ea4ec17c7093c9d7ebef02f4205a2d9dd4319b01d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/df/df55021174ec847f32637cebfa2d37abf8f5b5be8962c33d7f7a04a40d86d7f9.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"こおろぎ さとみ","creatorId":"vndb:s802","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s802","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s802","name":"こおろぎ さとみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:697","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c6571","characterName":"沙生 美緒","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c6571"},"originalCharacterName":"沙生 美緒","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"30"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"92"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"172"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"90"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"60"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The nurse at Hiroki's school. He has gotten to know her because he spends a lot of time there due to his illness. She is always cold to everyone, and seems to do nothing but sleep while she's at work. It seems the only way to crack her shell is to offer her something sweet to eat!"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From JAST USA"},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Her true name is Miharu Aso. She's not a qualified nur